   "evidence": "`grep -rn \"def weight\\|structure SumRuleAssumptions\\|def modelPdf\\|def valenceNumber\" upstream/` returns no `Parton/PDF` hits (no `**/Parton/**/*.lean` exists upstream at all); the declarations are at `EpsilonEridani/Particles/Parton/PDF/Basic.lean:129,241`, `Model.lean:100,230`, `ChargeConjugation.lean:153`, with `weight` and `sumRuleAssumptionsWeightModelPdfZeroOne` introduced in this diff. The same file names them in full as `EpsilonEridani.Particles.Parton.PDF.weight`/`.modelPdf` at lines 268-269, contradicting the \"upstream\" label.",
